  "summary": "The paper evaluates three gate-based hybrid quantum-classical PPO agents for Taiwan stock sector rotation: QNN, QRWKV, and QASA, each using 4 qubits and 2-4 quantum circuit layers. Although the quantum models achieve the highest training rewards (QASA 2883.30, QNN 2847.00, QRWKV 2653.40), they underperform classical baselines on test performance; for example, LSTM reaches 125.33% cumulative return and 0.88 Sharpe ratio versus QASA’s 93.14% and 0.71.",
